' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@53eff85c7f41de23eb434e027782f5085a8b8e45 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/service/command/CommandResponseAssembler.java help.
' Historical evidence: pi-mono-java@d1cdb708e3e124cae009b10b985f5832b6dbde01 had the same chain with the field named userCases.
' Observed behavior: Help reads one locked complete snapshot, projects authored metadata and returns an immutable three-field response.
' Design reason: keep cache and response detail out of the global diagram without hiding the implemented responsibility chain.

class CommandExecutionContext <<request snapshot>>
class HelpCommandContributor <<singleton>> {
  +definition(): BuiltinCommandDefinition
}
class AgentHelpQueryService <<application service>> #E3F2E1 {
  +query(session, arguments): HelpCommandResultDTO
}
class AgentRuntimeManager <<singleton>> {
  +prepareCached(agentId)
}
class PreparedAgentRuntime <<complete snapshot>> #E3F2E1
class "AgentIdentity / agent.json" as AgentIdentity <<stored metadata>> {
  name / displayName
  description[]
  useCases[]
}
class "HelpCommandResultDTO" as HelpData <<immutable request data>> #E3F2E1
class CommandResponseAssembler <<singleton>>
class AgentHelpResponseVO <<immutable response>> #E3F2E1 {
  displayName
  description[]
  useCases[]
}

HelpCommandContributor ..> CommandExecutionContext : handler lambda reads Session
HelpCommandContributor --> AgentHelpQueryService : delegates query
AgentHelpQueryService --> AgentRuntimeManager : one cached read
AgentRuntimeManager --> PreparedAgentRuntime : complete snapshot
AgentRuntimeManager --> AgentIdentity : publish / reload
AgentHelpQueryService ..> HelpData : whitelist projection
CommandResponseAssembler ..> HelpData : result DTO
CommandResponseAssembler ..> AgentHelpResponseVO : business VO

note bottom of AgentIdentity
Save and reload useCases in agent.json.
Refresh metadata explicitly outside Help.
Read and publication share the Agent lock.
end note

note bottom of AgentHelpResponseVO
Exactly three business fields; absent text is [].
No command discriminator or internal receipt.
No prompt, bindings, or runtime objects.
end note

legend bottom left
This is a Help-only detail view, not the global Command structure.
Help uses authored Agent metadata, not the command catalog.
No model/tool call, implicit refresh, Session Entry or execution lease.
CommandExecutionContext retains the common request catalog.
DTOs belong to runtimeapi.dto.command; VOs to runtimeapi.vo.
All shown Help classes and relations are implemented at the source baseline.
endlegend
@enduml
